coco/fonts.py contains converted bitmap data from VCC's cc2font.h and cc3font.h,
Copyright 2015 Joseph Forgione, GPL-3.0-or-later.
The CPU, memory/register, keyboard and video implementations were written in
Python with reference to VCC's mc6809.cpp, tcc1014mmu.cpp, tcc1014registers.cpp,
mc6821.cpp, keyboardLayout.cpp, tcc1014graphics.cpp and tcc1014graphics.h.
They are distributed under the same GPL-3.0-or-later license.

The Python audio, disk and event-timing implementations also use VCC's
mc6821.cpp, FD502/wd1793.cpp, tcc1014graphics.cpp and tcc1014graphics.h as
behavioral references. MAME's gime.cpp and coco_fdc.cpp were consulted to
cross-check frame latching, timer revision offsets and disk interface signals:
https://github.com/mamedev/mame/blob/master/src/mame/trs/gime.cpp
https://github.com/mamedev/mame/blob/master/src/devices/bus/coco/coco_fdc.cpp
CPU bus sequencing was subsequently adapted with reference to MAME's
src/devices/cpu/m6809/m6809.lst, base6x09.lst and m6809.h (Nathan Woods).
DMK parsing was cross-checked against src/lib/formats/dmk_dsk.cpp (Wilbert Pol).
These references carry BSD-3-Clause licenses; their attribution and terms are
retained in LICENSE-MAME. The Python implementations integrate with the GPL
project. Source references were consulted on 2026-11-21.

HFE and SCP format support was implemented using the published HxC HFE and
SuperCard Pro specifications. HFE v3 opcode semantics were cross-checked against
Keir Fraser's public-domain FlashFloppy implementation; continuous SCP flux
interval handling was cross-checked against his public-domain Greaseweazle
implementation. These projects and specifications are acknowledged here:
https://hxc2001.com/floppy_drive_emulator/HFE-file-format.html
https://www.cbmstuff.com/downloads/scp/scp_image_specs.txt
https://github.com/keirf/FlashFloppy/blob/master/src/image/hfe.c
https://github.com/keirf/greaseweazle/blob/master/src/greaseweazle/image/scp.py

CoCo system ROMs are user-supplied and are not included in this project.
The included LICENSE contains the full GPL version 3 text.
